  "description": "The Hover-1 Highlander is an affordable electric scooter with everything you need for a fun ride around town. Highlander is equipped with a 250W brushless motor that brings it to a max speed of 15 mph, and the rechargeable battery provides 9 miles of range. The battery only takes 3 hours to fully charge, so it won’t be long before you can get back on the road. Highlander can even scale a 20 degree incline, separating it from most other electric scooters. Want to bring it on a road trip or store it in a tight spot? Simply fold the steering column to the foot deck. If you’re on a budget but don’t want to compromise on performance, the Hover-1 Highlander is an excellent choice.",
